  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given A is rarest, monoatomic, non-radioactive p-block element and form \\(\\mathrm{AX}_4 \\mathrm{Y}\\) type of molecule.<br />\\(\\therefore\\) It is concluded that it is Xe<br />It is given the electronegativity of A is less than X & Y<br />It is given the electronegativity of \\(\\mathrm{X} ~\\&~ \\mathrm{Y}\\) is highest and second highest respectively among all element.<br />\\(\\therefore \\mathrm{X} ~\\&~ \\mathrm{Y}\\) are \\(\\mathrm{F} ~\\&~ \\mathrm{O}\\)<br />\\(\\therefore\\) Compound is consider as \\(\\mathrm{XeOF}_4\\) with square pyramidal shape.<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7NAkJh5keXONoNBDPNP9oh_674ODZjDEABsFfogriW8.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>",
    "image": null
